      "visual_action_start_seconds": 155.96666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.011833333333328255,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The two prediction lanes lock into one MIRROR DISCRIMINANT diagram, the visual and spoken peak.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "discipline",
      "text": "Before any number was computed, we fixed the mirror logic, every cut, both thresholds, and paired comparisons.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s11-1d072584576a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "f3374f86d87b37f38f04cdb5d66e6c2f976307caf77cbbf501b38212713e0a2a",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s11.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "bc0c739e5292acef0f3db6f87d3fec04adfc9bb0b01989fa25b1452783f90447",
      "audio_start_sample": 8018651,
      "audio_end_sample": 8334299,
      "audio_start_seconds": 167.05522916666666,
      "audio_end_seconds": 173.63122916666666,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5012,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 167.06666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.011437499999999545,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "A pre-registration bracket closes around MIRROR, CUTS, THRESHOLDS, and PAIRED COMPARISON.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "The frozen Galaxy Zoo 1 source contains 667,944 rows.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s12-390ca91eca91.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "9809de12953816842e42460cfd69389645393ce744287d5a29de505c21ba27c8",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s12.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "3bbba278a8ea09b2469aec49ca18f8d77a44507f11e4b8822250bc0687d75a1e",
      "audio_start_sample": 8530734,
      "audio_end_sample": 8840622,
      "audio_start_seconds": 177.723625,
      "audio_end_seconds": 184.179625,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5332,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 177.73333333333332,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.009708333333321661,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "Row particles stream into a Galaxy Zoo 1 data release, Table 2 reservoir with the sample size attached.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "funnel",
      "text": "Three parallel readouts apply the spiral flag and two frozen thresholds; exact counts stay attached to their branches.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s13-1a27c2ca9817.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "acc642e05b998eb5192014743726b8c681f2499cb363f01d53b744f006158a95",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s13.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "52990fb7a55c2a4bc9d972e355794da76a0f3b47174702fa38c090d1b9d06ae3",
      "audio_start_sample": 8876622,
      "audio_end_sample": 9194574,
      "audio_start_seconds": 184.929625,
      "audio_end_seconds": 191.553625,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5548,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 184.93333333333334,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.003708333333349856,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The source splits into three parallel branches; each labeled stage reveals its exact row count.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Within one readout, N C W and N A C W count the labels.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s14-fedecb328ae8.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "fa679c3cd204efa85f774b4a420524a162c7f8aac59f9861c76969806a7fa3d3",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s14.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "e381fa4f9e8f2d8abc8fe8181c3ed6e44a4fed2aabae22e85835e4f54448c22f",
      "audio_start_sample": 9391009,
      "audio_end_sample": 9668641,
      "audio_start_seconds": 195.64602083333332,
      "audio_end_seconds": 201.43002083333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 5869,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 195.63333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.012687499999998408,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "N_CW and N_ACW chips detach from one branch and enter a formula workspace.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "Their difference is the numerator, and their total is the denominator.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s15-b20390383d0f.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "216b0399dee8dfa8e6ef97ef2ca18f6927371223271fdb48a321bac98451e117",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s15.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "ccc60223644cdbfe2796dd6f7ca742de1f25e2d1f089d17df44fcde299c985a0",
      "audio_start_sample": 9704641,
      "audio_end_sample": 9873985,
      "audio_start_seconds": 202.18002083333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 205.70802083333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 6065,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 202.16666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.013354166666687206,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The numerator and denominator build term by term around a fraction bar.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "equation",
      "text": "The sign would indicate which label is more numerous, but the predeclared asymmetry value remains withheld.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s16-57707812688a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "56fb2c7785dc66b2237333621ca4909966b74b26dc3513560f2d6eedd43bfaf3",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s16.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "bb6a7b12d5ee3bbf4912d46b3f12df20416b9679b465c986eb74e2bbd574ea07",
      "audio_start_sample": 9909985,
      "audio_end_sample": 10224481,
      "audio_start_seconds": 206.45802083333334,
      "audio_end_seconds": 213.01002083333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 6194,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 206.46666666666667,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.008645833333332575,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "A symmetric unselected sign rail appears; the symbolic equation completes and a value lock closes in the same state.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "The control matrix joins the mirror, both thresholds, and same-object pairs.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s17-3d9085cd8f35.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "82905bb6336d0ed96d7aa4e93b9a53147981d2c6e3427e949d4b5a81f08de151",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s17.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "004e3c3afd342089f44f7f651a7ee1e068137d55960e4b77a8c04bf757414030",
      "audio_start_sample": 10420916,
      "audio_end_sample": 10676660,
      "audio_start_seconds": 217.10241666666667,
      "audio_end_seconds": 222.43041666666667,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 6513,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 217.1,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0024166666666758374,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "Three control rows reveal: mirror, thresholds, paired same object.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "controls",
      "text": "They test inversion, threshold sensitivity, and individual change versus sample composition; design only.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s18-4d1afd6be2a8.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "37ae44e09030e9a3aa59af32bc3df6673d97115c5f19032902bd651553257223",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s18.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "94f1f0a06d3d0883831c4641089316eba1d0e960b8df10f498e55567513cfdc1",
      "audio_start_sample": 10712660,
      "audio_end_sample": 11062868,
      "audio_start_seconds": 223.18041666666667,
      "audio_end_seconds": 230.47641666666667,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 6695,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 223.16666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.013750000000015916,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "Each control connects to its tested failure mode; DESIGN ONLY banner wipes across.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "discipline-gates",
      "text": "We tied our own hands so the answer cannot be shaped by choices made after seeing it.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s19-b62c1d547b78.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "5746472401c7e168e595cbee3021e61d18531017096cbf6a2bc476d14ae17708",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s19.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "873f56874f99f601391f6cd9695d60c2cb57b23d32800ef4f792eee6e42e40f2",
      "audio_start_sample": 11259303,
      "audio_end_sample": 11492007,
      "audio_start_seconds": 234.5688125,
      "audio_end_seconds": 239.4168125,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 7037,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 234.56666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0021458333333441715,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "A discipline seal closes around the full method while later-choice arrows are visibly blocked.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "section": "discipline-gates",
      "text": "That standard makes the independent post-run verdict the next gate; the stored-direction frame and evidence, receipt, and referee checks must also meet the frozen rules.",
      "word_count": 25,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s20-b1363e4835be.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "03ad8ff381816cc7ec35b0b1809b0ef69cbe1c6c37d025689ae793338ca818c4",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s20.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "c55936952ee74b3acb35a622885bf39243e2eaf704be60c83bff5a53e68d1856",
      "audio_start_sample": 11528007,
      "audio_end_sample": 11988807,
      "audio_start_seconds": 240.1668125,
      "audio_end_seconds": 249.7668125,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 7205,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 240.16666666666666,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.00014583333333462178,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "Specific open review nodes appear as consequences of the self-imposed standard; a pulse stops before the answer field.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "section": "boundary",
      "text": "Known now are the sample, estimator, mirror logic, and controls; no result value, direction, or interpretation is reportable.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s21-7356873d828a.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "5d48c9ea4795fbfa3a7fbaa902a327c890e048e7d264bc3d989d7184b7e9c174",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s21.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "0f1d2615f758ae9e2611e730252a9d98230a073af25d65a2f2d9885030a0678c",
      "audio_start_sample": 12024807,
      "audio_end_sample": 12416487,
      "audio_start_seconds": 250.5168125,
      "audio_end_seconds": 258.6768125,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 7516,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 250.53333333333333,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.01652083333334531,
      "pause_after_samples": 196435,
      "pause_after_seconds": 4.092395833333334,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "KNOWN and NOT REPORTABLE boundary columns build from the discipline diagram.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "section": "payoff",
      "text": "Ask the opening question again: images or labeling process?",
      "word_count": 9,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s22-c6ceeafd1436.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "38fc3886b3b5e926e3162d0ec9639c9e480abd61a0052d91ec1ed25a3382df2d",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s22.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "625fbe4ad015740e9c617b27c42411ade2b8e4d8799a8369d1709c72a70f5680",
      "audio_start_sample": 12612922,
      "audio_end_sample": 12819130,
      "audio_start_seconds": 262.7692083333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 267.0652083333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 7883,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 262.76666666666665,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.0025416666666728815,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The exact two-explanation question returns above the completed mirror discriminant.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "section": "payoff",
      "text": "Now we have a mirror test that forces those explanations to behave differently.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s23-4d2b901e7477.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "74debffc0450325f65121ec5cbd7454ff1bd0bd8cafe8d77821df43b62794853",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s23.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "00009c489831eae8a4947a5458234cd39bb1350695d56bada3ac11f4b9508fc4",
      "audio_start_sample": 12855130,
      "audio_end_sample": 13069402,
      "audio_start_seconds": 267.8152083333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 272.2792083333333,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 8034,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 267.8,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.01520833333330529,
      "pause_after_samples": 36000,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.75,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The mirror diagram reconnects both explanation lanes to a gated, still-empty answer field.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "section": "payoff",
      "text": "Its gate-cleared answer is still missing; the scientific discriminant is not.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "raw_file": "audio_v5/raw/s24-e88ebb77a400.mp3",
      "raw_file_sha256": "7c7cc7099a71a9fb0e2c12b442f583180281ae5a31559a748e5adf9f96888556",
      "decoded_file": "audio_v5/decoded/s24.wav",
      "decoded_file_sha256": "78976bcb22f34cc134b6ef726051cb76befaeab330f68afe5ba5d60117bf61a0",
      "audio_start_sample": 13105402,
      "audio_end_sample": 13351930,
      "audio_start_seconds": 273.0292083333333,
      "audio_end_seconds": 278.16520833333334,
      "visual_action_start_frame": 8191,
      "visual_action_start_seconds": 273.03333333333336,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.004125000000044565,
      "pause_after_samples": 0,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0,
      "beat": null,
      "visual_action": "The final frame holds the scientific discriminant and the two explanations, not a workflow slogan.",
      "display_citation": null,
      "timing_status": "PCM_DERIVED_FINAL"
    }
  ]
}
